        "original_id": "dbe68359-f197-5cee-80b7-a33144a5dc5f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Meic Stevens, Jimmy Savile\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, DJ, television and radio personality, dance hall manager, charity fundraiser\n- Places: Wales, Manchester\n- Events: discovery at a folk club performance in 1965\n\nFacts:\n- Jimmy Savile was born on 31 October 1926 and died on 29 October 2011.\n- Jimmy Savile was an English DJ, television and radio personality, dance hall manager, and charity fundraiser.\n- In 1965, Jimmy Savile saw Meic Stevens performing in a Manchester folk club and discovered him.\n- Meic Stevens was still largely unknown outside Wales at the time Jimmy Savile discovered him.",
